---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SimplePromptTool from '../components/SimplePromptTool';
import PricingSection from '../components/PricingSection';

Astro.response.headers.set('Cache-Control', 's-maxage=300, stale-while-revalidate=3600');
---
<Layout
  title="Free Sora Prompt Generator — Sora Prompt Examples, Templates & Guide"
  description="Generate the best Sora prompts instantly. Free Sora prompt generator with examples, templates, and a built-in guide — adds camera motion, lighting, and cinematic style automatically. No sign-up."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="px-6 pt-14 pb-10 text-center border-b-2 border-[#1c1c1c]">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] leading-tight mb-5">Sora Prompt Generator</h1>
    <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Turn a simple idea into a cinematic Sora prompt. Our free Sora prompt generator adds camera motion, scene composition, lighting, and visual style details that OpenAI Sora needs to generate stunning AI videos.
    </p>
    <a href="#root" class="inline-block px-10 py-4 bg-[#f0b429] border-2 border-[#1c1c1c] rounded-xl font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] text-lg hover:brightness-95 transition-all">
      Generate Sora Prompt — Free
    </a>
    <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-sm mt-3">3 free generations per day — no credit card required</p>
  </section>

  <div id="root">
    <SimplePromptTool
      client:only="react"
      seoTitle="Sora Prompt Generator"
      seoDescription="Generate cinematic video prompts for OpenAI Sora."
      inputPlaceholder="Describe your video idea... e.g. a lone astronaut walking on a red desert planet at sunset"
      buttonLabel="Generate Sora Prompt"
      toolType="sora"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-12 space-y-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="border border-[#c8c0a8] rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-3">Why Use a Sora Prompt Generator?</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Sora interprets every detail of your prompt to construct a video — camera angle, motion speed, lighting mood, subject behaviour, and background depth. Vague prompts produce generic results. Our Sora prompt generator automatically layers in cinematic language, shot types, movement cues, and atmospheric detail so Sora has everything it needs to generate exactly what you imagined.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-[#c8c0a8] rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-4">What Gets Added to Your Sora Prompts</h3>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5">🎬</span><p class="text-[#6b6559] text-sm">Camera: shot type, angle, motion, and focal length</p></div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5">💡</span><p class="text-[#6b6559] text-sm">Lighting: time of day, mood, shadows, colour temperature</p></div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5">🌍</span><p class="text-[#6b6559] text-sm">Scene: environment, background depth, atmosphere</p></div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5">🎞️</span><p class="text-[#6b6559] text-sm">Style: film grain, aspect ratio, cinematic references</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border border-[#c8c0a8] rounded-xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-3">Sora Prompt Guide: Structure That Gets Results</h2>
      <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-sm leading-relaxed">
        The best sora prompt template follows a proven structure: <strong>subject + action → environment → camera movement → lighting → visual style</strong>. Most Sora prompts fail because they describe what to show but not how to show it. This sora prompt guide structure is applied automatically — turning your plain-language idea into a full cinematic brief Sora can execute on the first generation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="border border-[#c8c0a8] rounded-xl p-6">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-3">Sora Prompt Examples</h3>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="bg-[#faf8f3] border border-[#e8e0cc] rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-[#1a1a1a] text-xs font-semibold mb-1">Cinematic landscape</p>
          <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-xs font-mono leading-relaxed">"Slow aerial dolly over a misty Nordic fjord at dawn, golden light breaking through low clouds, still water reflecting the mountains, 24mm wide angle, cinematic colour grade"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#faf8f3] border border-[#e8e0cc] rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-[#1a1a1a] text-xs font-semibold mb-1">Character scene</p>
          <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-xs font-mono leading-relaxed">"Medium close-up of a weathered astronaut removing her helmet on a red desert planet, dust particles catching warm backlight, slow camera push-in, dramatic shadows, 35mm film grain"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#faf8f3] border border-[#e8e0cc] rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-[#1a1a1a] text-xs font-semibold mb-1">Urban motion</p>
          <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-xs font-mono leading-relaxed">"Tracking shot following a courier through rain-soaked Tokyo at night, neon signs reflected on wet tarmac, handheld feel, motion blur on background, vivid colour contrast"</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border border-[#c8c0a8] rounded-xl p-6">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-[#1a1a1a] text-sm">Is this Sora prompt generator free?</p>
          <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-xs mt-1">Yes — free, no sign-up needed. Generate Sora prompts instantly.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-[#1a1a1a] text-sm">What makes the best Sora prompt?</p>
          <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-xs mt-1">The best sora prompts always specify: subject and action, camera shot type and movement, lighting conditions, environment, and visual style. Our generator adds all five automatically from your plain description.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-[#1a1a1a] text-sm">How long should a Sora prompt be?</p>
          <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-xs mt-1">Sora works best with detailed prompts of 2–5 sentences covering scene, camera, and style. Single-line prompts produce generic results. This generator builds the right length automatically.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-[#1a1a1a] text-sm">What are the top Sora prompt tips?</p>
          <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-xs mt-1">Key sora prompt tips: always name a camera movement (dolly, pan, push-in), include time of day for natural lighting, specify a visual style reference, and describe what changes during the clip. This generator applies all four automatically.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-[#1a1a1a] text-sm">Can I use these prompts for other video AI tools?</p>
          <p class="text-[#6b6559] text-xs mt-1">Yes — cinematic prompts generated here work well with Runway, Kling, HiggsField, and other AI video platforms too.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="#root" class="block w-full py-4 bg-[#f0b429] border-2 border-[#1c1c1c] rounded-xl text-center font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] text-lg hover:brightness-95 transition-all">
      Generate Your Sora Prompt
    </a>
  </div>

  <PricingSection client:load priceIds={{
    starterMonthly: import.meta.env.STRIPE_PRICE_STARTER_MONTHLY,
    starterYearly: import.meta.env.STRIPE_PRICE_STARTER_YEARLY,
    proMonthly: import.meta.env.STRIPE_PRICE_PRO_MONTHLY,
    proYearly: import.meta.env.STRIPE_PRICE_PRO_YEARLY,
    unlimitedMonthly: import.meta.env.STRIPE_PRICE_UNLIMITED_MONTHLY,
    unlimitedYearly: import.meta.env.STRIPE_PRICE_UNLIMITED_YEARLY,
  }} />
</Layout>
